{"body":"## Summary\n\n- synchronize the root `Cargo.lock` entry in automated release commits and stage it with `Cargo.toml`\n- make every relevant Cargo check, test, build, package, Docker, and manual-build path reject stale lockfiles with `--locked`\n- upgrade GitHub-maintained actions to Node 24-compatible releases and add explicit permissions, timeouts, retry/default-branch settings, warning-denied docs, and release-script tests\n- fail dependency audits on warnings, updating `anyhow` and the yanked transitive `spin` release\n- preserve the complete issue, PR, CI, template-comparison, online-research, timeline, and root-cause evidence in `dev/log/issues/63/pulls/64`\n\n## Root cause and reproduction\n\nThe release automation changed and staged `Cargo.toml` but not `Cargo.lock`. Unlocked `cargo clippy`, `cargo test`, and `cargo build` then silently repaired their private checkout lockfiles before the existing version assertion ran, producing false-positive checks. The final strict package step detected the dirty mutation and failed.\n\nThe pre-fix reproduction is preserved in `dev/log/issues/63/pulls/64/ci-logs/local-reproduction-cargo-check-locked.log`; the initial failing regression run is in `local-failing-regression-tests.log`.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `rust-script --test scripts/version-and-commit.rs` (3 tests)\n- `cargo test --locked --all-features --verbose` (full suite)\n- `cargo test --locked --doc --verbose`\n- `cargo check --locked --all-targets --all-features`\n- `cargo clippy --locked --all-targets --all-features`\n- `RUSTDOCFLAGS=-D warnings cargo doc --locked --no-deps --all-features`\n- clean-tree `cargo package --locked --list`\n- `cargo audit` with warnings denied; `npm audit --audit-level=high`\n- `cargo fmt --all -- --check`, actionlint, YAML parsing, and file-size checks\n- `docker build --target runtime .`\n\nThis is not a visual/UI change, so screenshots are not applicable.\n\nFixes #63\n","createdAt":"2026-08-08T16:25:36Z","files":[{"path":